  ('letting-kindness-in', 1, 'The next time someone compliments you today, say "Thank you" and stop there, without explaining it away.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 2, 'Notice the first moment today when you want to brush off something kind, and take one slow breath before you answer.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 3, 'When a coworker praises your work, resist pointing out what is still wrong with it. Let "Thanks, I worked hard on that" be the whole reply.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 4, 'Write down one nice thing someone said to you today, word for word, before you go to bed.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 5, 'Start a folder on your phone or computer called "Kind Words" and save one message that made you smile.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 6, 'If someone says they like your outfit, skip "Oh, this old thing" and try "Thanks, I like it too."'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 7, 'Let a friend pay for your coffee today, if they offer, without promising to get the next one.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 8, 'When someone holds a door for you, slow down, make eye contact and say "Thank you" instead of hurrying through.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 9, 'Reread one card, note or text from someone who cares about you, and read it slowly, as if it were new.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 10, 'Say "You''re welcome" the next time someone thanks you, instead of "No problem" or "It was nothing."'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 11, 'Accept a compliment today without handing one straight back. You can return kindness another time.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 12, 'Think of one compliment you dismissed recently. Write it on a sticky note and put it where you will see it tonight.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 13, 'If a neighbor offers to help with your yard, your trash cans or a package, say yes to one small thing.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 14, 'At dinner tonight, let someone else serve you a plate, and stay seated while they do it.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 15, 'Before you reply to a kind text today, read it twice. Let the words land before you type anything.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 16, 'When a store clerk wishes you a good day, pause and wish them one back, letting the warmth go both ways.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 17, 'Tell one person today how a kind thing they did for you recently actually felt.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 18, 'Practice saying "Thank you, that means a lot" out loud, alone, until it sounds like your own voice.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 19, 'If someone offers to carry a bag or a box for you today, hand it over and walk beside them.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 20, 'Let a coworker cover one small task for you this week without making up an excuse for why you need it.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 21, 'Pick one person who often praises you. Write down three kind things they have said over the years.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 22, 'When someone gives you a gift, open it slowly and name one specific thing you like about it.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 23, 'Catch yourself apologizing for taking up someone''s time, and swap it for "Thanks for making time for me."'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 24, 'Notice where in your body you feel awkward when someone is kind to you. Name the spot, then let your shoulders drop.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 25, 'When a friend asks how you are, give a real answer instead of turning the question back to them right away.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 26, 'Accept a seat if someone offers you one on the bus or train today, and thank them with a smile.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 27, 'Save one kind email from work into your "Kind Words" folder before you log off for the day.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 28, 'If you feel guilty after someone helps you, write one sentence about why they might have wanted to help.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 29, 'Let someone else choose the restaurant or the movie tonight, and enjoy being taken care of.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 30, 'When praised in front of others, let the moment sit for a breath instead of rushing to change the subject.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 31, 'Text a friend who supported you through something hard and tell them one moment you still remember.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 32, 'If a child gives you a drawing today, look at it closely and ask them to tell you about it.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 33, 'Keep a small notebook by your bed and jot down one moment you were cared for today.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 34, 'When someone says "Great job," try answering with "Thanks, I''m proud of it" just once today.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 35, 'Say yes to a refill or a taste of something when someone offers it warmly and you would enjoy it.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 36, 'Look at a photo of a time someone threw you a party or celebrated you, and remember how it felt.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 37, 'Is there a favor you turned down this month out of habit? Think about whether you might say yes next time.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 38, 'Practice receiving a hug today: let it last a breath longer than usual, if it feels right to you.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 39, 'Ask a friend to tell you one thing they appreciate about you, and listen without interrupting.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 40, 'Let a family member make you a cup of tea or coffee today, and drink it while it is warm.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 41, 'If someone compliments your cooking, skip listing what went wrong and say "I''m glad you liked it."'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 42, 'Notice a time today when you said "Sorry" but meant "Thank you." Write down what you could say next time.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 43, 'Accept help with directions or a map from a stranger today, even if you think you could find it alone.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 44, 'When someone remembers a detail about your life, tell them it means something that they remembered.'),
