  ('letting-kindness-in', 67, 'If an offer of help does not feel right, decline it kindly. Receiving well includes choosing what to let in.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 68, 'Put one kind note you received somewhere you will see it each morning, like a mirror or the fridge.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 69, 'At a store, let an employee carry your purchase to the car if they offer.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 70, 'When someone compliments your home, thank them and point out one thing you love about it too.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 71, 'Let a friend pick up a small thing for you while they are out, like milk or stamps.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 72, 'Before bed, close your eyes and replay one warm moment from today for a full minute.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 73, 'Ask someone you trust for a hug today, and let yourself enjoy it without apology.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 74, 'The next time you open a present, skip "You shouldn''t have" and say "I love that you thought of this."'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 75, 'Resist apologizing for what a gift cost the giver. Thank them for the thought and leave the price out of it.'),
