  ('letting-kindness-in', 298, 'Hand over the grocery list to someone who offered to shop, and resist checking on them.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 299, 'Let the barista or cashier who knows your order make your morning, and tell them it is appreciated.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 300, 'Linger a moment after someone holds an elevator for you, and say "Thanks for waiting."'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 301, 'Open a card at the table rather than saving it for later, and read the message out loud if you like.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 302, 'Show the gift giver you are using their present, like wearing the scarf or plating food on the dish.'),
  ('letting-kindness-in', 303, 'Keep a gift receipt out of sight, and use the present for a week before deciding anything about it.'),
